<!-- 2026-08-23: roster extension — Re2000 (Gray, Fighter), SM79 Bomber/Torpedo (Gray,
     Attacker), V-156-F (Green, Attacker/Bomber). Same starting-position guess as the
     Re2001/MS406/Potez630 batch (FC20's own tuned offset), same caveat: NOT independently
     verified for these planes, especially SM79 — it's a 3-engine medium bomber, physically
     much larger than FC20/Re2001/MS406/Potez630, and may not fit this Hangar shell's
     interior at all; if it doesn't, it likely belongs in a Factory-type installation instead
     (see NPC-WW2-Factory-Plane-*.sbc), not this Hangar shell.
     V-156-F: only ONE Player-tier blueprint exists (Player-WW2-V-156-F.sbc) despite the
     Roadmap tracking NPC-WW2-V-156-F-Bomber and -Torpedo as two separate done items — set
     up the one that exists; flag the Player-tier Torpedo variant as a gap if a second one
     was intended. -->

